      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LILAH RAINBOW (7) pinged the lids and was in the firing line early but drifted out of it when 5th at this track in Grade 5 company. Has a good record here at this journey. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. Should be very hard to beat this time. SIMPKIN (6) jumps from box 6 again after finishing a 1.75 lengths second (22.55) last time at this track over 390m. Expected to feature. IVORY QUILL (3) finished second (22.94) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. The form out of her last race has been franked. Warrants plenty of respect. MOSI (2) justified the favourite's tag last time and is a major player again.",
